window.products.push({"id":589147,"name":"Portable Air Conditioner, Quiet USB Desktop Small Mini Personal Evaporative Air Cooler Fan with 7 Colors Night Light, for Home Office Outdoors Travel,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RhcCEOc3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【INSTANTLY & EFFICIENTLY COOLING】: Cooler than fan, and more energy saving than air conditioner, the ENKLEN portable air conditioner is born for cooling your hot summer! When the hot air go through the ice curtain soaked in ice water, it will be cooled 3-10℃ down. Only in 3s, the mini air cooler blows out the cool wind to you, what keeps your personal space at around 25℃ for about 6 hours. 【2019 FULLY UPGRADE】: Compared to the some old models that have large volume, small wind, loud noise, poor cooling effect and various quality problems, this new designed personal air conditioner is completely upgraded. Every item is strictly quality checked, and really quiet, lightweight, small, meanwhile provides great cooling effect. A 380ml water tank allows 6 hours cooling effect, the fashion appearance and colorful night light give you not only cool, but pleasant. 【FRESH AND MISTING AIR】: The filter in the mini air cooler can not only provide pleasing cool air, it can also filter out odors and dust in the air, provide misting, fresh and healthy air to your baby, elders. Especially good for sleeping, and people with respiratory sensitivities. 【ANYWHERE PORTABLE】: The USB portable air conditioner can powered by such as power banks, laptops and other devices with USB ports, you can enjoy cool air anywhere you go, in your office, bedroom, tent, and tours. It's also very energy saving and environmental friendly, keep using for 7 days only cost 1kW·h. 【WARRANTY】: 100% satisfaction, 7-15 days free shipping, lifetime warranty. if there is any problem, please feel free to ask, we will reply within 24hrs, and we will try our best to solve it or send another free one or make a refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RhcCEOc3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Anbber","source_asin":"B07SFLLNY1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-589147","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SFLLNY1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SFLLNY1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
