window.products.push({"id":589285,"name":"Foil and Plastic Wrap Organizer, 3 in 1 Bamboo Wrap Dispenser with Cutter Dispenser Foil Bamboo Roll Organizer Holder Aluminum Foil and Wax Paper Disp","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BN98lxWBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🏬【3 in 1 wrap dispenser with cutter】This foil and plastic wrap organizer comes with three slots, providing plenty of space to organize your foil, plastic packaging and wax paper. The foil and plastic wrap organizer can store plastic wrap, foil, wax paper and parchment at the same time, making your kitchen and drawers more tidy and convenient. 🏬【SELECTED STRONG MATERIALS】This foil dispenser with cutter with cutter is made of natural renewable bamboo, the surface is sealed with paint, finely polished by hand, waterproof and durable, can be used for many years. Bamboo is a great alternative to plastic as it is a renewable resource that adds a warm, natural feel to the kitchen. 🏬【SUITABLE FOR MULTIPLE PAPER CUTTINGS】Bamboo wrap dispenser with cutter is compatible with plastic wrap, aluminum foil and wax paper, suitable for wrapping rolls of plastic wrap, aluminum foil, baking parchment and wax paper, 12 inches and less than 12 inches wide. Not compatible with rolls wider than 12 inches. 🏬【Clamshell design is easy to use】Innovative sliding knife, get the job done quickly and easily! Take into account that the packaging will roll to make it easier to remove the foil and wax paper. The opening extends to 8 cm. Clamshell design, easier to open, easier to change materials. The larger opening in the middle makes it easier to find the reel starting line. Pull the cutting knife and slide it gently to cut, simple and convenient. 🏬【Built-in Sliding Cutter】Each slot has a two-way concealed cutting knife, providing perfect distribution and cutting, each slot has a sliding cutter, smooth cutting packaging, safe design, no assembly, easy to clean, Just wipe with a damp cloth and won't hurt your fingers. And with an English logo sticker, you can paste it at will to make it more beautiful. 🏬【Best Choice as a Gift】Our roll dispenser with slide cutter is a good helper at home and can also be used in restaurants and cafeterias, ideal as a gift for mothers, girlfriends and friends. Anyone who likes to keep their kitchen looking neat will be ecstatic to receive one of these plastic packaging storage rack cutters! 🏬【7 Label Stickers Included】Use the labels on the box to instantly identify the drawer contents; you can label the bamboo organizer clearly, or keep the packaging clean with no labels. 2 FOIL, 2 PLASTIC, 2 WAX, 1 PARCHMENT with 3 screws for easy fixing on the wall and 4 non-slip silicone handles to prevent slipping and protect the counter from scratches. 🏬【Warm Tips】The size of the 3 in 1 dispenser foil is 14.5\" x 9.76\" x 3.54\", you can use it to store any size roll up to 12 inches and these organizers require 3 inches of drawer space. Note: Please measure the size of the drawer as well as the material before buying to make sure it fits!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BN98lxWBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cozomga","source_asin":"B0BC1M671C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-589285","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BC1M671C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BC1M671C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
