window.products.push({"id":589394,"name":"PENGJIEBlue Bouquet Passion Flower Plant -Passiflora - 4\" Pot","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EGvCv0ndL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"PASSION FLOWER: Passion flowers are exotic looking topical plants that can actually be grown in much milder areas. There are many different passion flower plants. Some passion flowers are vines, some produce edible fruits. The genus Passiflora contains over 400 species. The name ‘Passion’ Flower comes from Spanish Christian missionaries who adopted the unique physical structures of this plant, particularly the numbers of its various flower parts, as symbols of the last days of Jesus and especially his crucifixion. Passion Vine 'Blue Bouquet'- A vigorous grower that puts on a fantastic show in any garden setting. This heavy bloomer can have more than 100 blooms open at one time. The beautiful flowers are bluish-purple, about 3 inches in diameter and appear from summer through fall. This vine grows 6 to 8 feet in height and is suitable for trellises, fences, or even mailboxes. Blue Bouquet is quite drought tolerant but will do better if watered regularly. This passion vine will tolerate some cold but will not withstand prolonged periods of freezing temperatures. Great for containers where it is not hardy. Prefers full sun, but will tolerate some shade. Growing Zone: 8-11. In cooler areas grow outside in the summer and trim and move indoors in the winter.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EGvCv0ndL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hirt's Gardens","source_asin":"B002A97JIA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-589394","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002A97JIA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002A97JIA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
