window.products.push({"id":589671,"name":"X Rocker, Basecamp Modern Full Gaming Bed, 77.64\" x 56.3\" x 36.22\", Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":289.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91AOMcphf+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BUILT-IN TV MOUNT I Built-in standard VESA mount can hold TV screens up to 32\", while the shelf above it provides a place to tuck away cables as well as store consoles, games, gear, and more SHADED MESH SIDES I Grid mesh sides reduce sun-glare and other game-ending distractions - just pull up an X Rocker chair or crash pad futon to create a complete gaming setup SLEEK AND STYLISH I The black color and modern design make it a perfect addition to any contemporary living space, adding both function and style to your home DURABLE METAL FRAME I Made with high-quality black metal frame materials to ensure durability and longevity EASY STORAGE I Simple to assemble under-bed storage cavity with a metal mesh frame that allows airflow and prevents consoles from overheating - Dimensions 78.5\" x 56.3\" x 38\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91AOMcphf+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"X Rocker","source_asin":"B09F7RS6SJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-589671","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09F7RS6SJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09F7RS6SJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":589672,"name":"Woven Wall Basket Large Sizes - Boho Home Decor - Wall Art - Set of 6 Seagrass Baskets with Unique Patterns - Wall basket Decor for Kitchen, Living Ro","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91DVY25dMnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you are looking for new wall decorations to add to your boho, rustic or farmhouse decor these baskets may be just what you have been searching for. They are handmade by professional weavers out of seagrass and finely woven with black, white and greys. Their neutral colors will match well with any other décor you already have. This set comes with 6 total baskets and are larger than most typical sets: 3 flat and 3 curved with a diameter of 14 inches (1), 12 inches (2) and 10 inches (3). Each basket has a different elegant design (as pictured) that is eye-catching without being distracting. They are also multifunctional and can be used in many aspects of your home décor. Not only do they make beautiful wall art, but you can use them as a tray for remotes, keys or accessories or even use them as a centerpiece to hold decorations, candles or plants. Set up for these baskets is very easy. We recommend laying out the baskets on the floor or a hard surface in order to determine what pattern of baskets will look best on your wall. Then install nails, hooks or command strips on the wall you desire to decorate and hang the baskets using the pre-installed loops that were woven into the back of them. This mix of woven baskets not only gives you many options for decoration, but they would also make a wonderful gift for that hard to shop for person in your life. Make your birthday, anniversary, wedding, holiday, Christmas or housewarming gift shopping easy and buy them this set that they will surely love.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91DVY25dMnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Happy Doge LLC","source_asin":"B0BDV38LDC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-589672","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BDV38LDC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BDV38LDC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
