window.products.push({"id":589923,"name":"Flexzion Ice Ball Mold Maker, Round Ice Spheres Ice Cube Tray Mold for Whiskey - Flexible Silicone Mold with Lids for 1.8\" Large Ice Sphere Mold for W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.79,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51vQN5BySML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why are bartenders using spherical balls of ice in drinks, nowadays?An ice sphere has over 24 percent less surface area that is exposed to the warm liquid, which in turns slow down the ice melting process in a drink than a cube of ice. This way, you can chill the drink without quickly diluting it.With our Ice Ball Maker Sphere Mold, you'll be able to impress your friends and family with more interesting, better tasting, cooler party drinks! Use them at bars and restaurants to up the aesthetics of your drink menu! Whether you're a bartender, casual drinker, party animal, or you simply want to enjoy a nice cool drink on a summer's day, with our Modern Ice Sphere Maker, you can enjoy any beverage of your choice, with cool looking ice balls that last up to 10x longer than regular square or cylindrical ice cubes!Tips for using Ice Ball Mold Maker:1. Fill the ice tray with \"distilled\" water2. The primary reason for causing ice to crack is freezing it too quickly. Try turn up the temperature of your freezer, wrap it in a hand cloth, or put the ice tray in a container.3. Ice ball could take up to 18 hours to freeze Specification: Makes four 1.8 inches (4.5cm) ice spheres Makes four 1.8 inches (4.5cm) ice spheres Made from BPA-free silicone Made from BPA-free silicone Dishwasher-safe Dishwasher-safe Color: White Color: White Tips for using Ice Ball Mold Maker: Tips for using Ice Ball Mold Maker: Fill the ice tray with \"distilled\" water Fill the ice tray with \"distilled\" water The primary reason for causing ice to crack is freezing it too quickly. Try turn up the temperature of your freezer, wrap it in a hand cloth, or put the ice tray in a container. The primary reason for causing ice to crack is freezing it too quickly. Try turn up the temperature of your freezer, wrap it in a hand cloth, or put the ice tray in a container. Ice ball could take up to 18 hours to freeze Ice ball could take up to 18 hours to freeze Package Content: 1 x Ice Ball Mold Maker, Round Ice Spheres Ice Cube Tray Mold for Whiskey - Flexible Silicone Mold with Lids for 1.8\" Large Ice Sphere Mold for Whiskey Chilling Bourbon Cocktail, Beverages 1 x Ice Ball Mold Maker, Round Ice Spheres Ice Cube Tray Mold for Whiskey - Flexible Silicone Mold with Lids for 1.8\" Large Ice Sphere Mold for Whiskey Chilling Bourbon Cocktail, Beverages","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51vQN5BySML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Flexzion","source_asin":"B09ND37F83","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-589923","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ND37F83","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ND37F83","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
