window.products.push({"id":589945,"name":"SIEMOO Large DIY Wall Clock Kit, 3D Frameless Wall Clock Kit Modern Design Mirror Number Stickers Clock for Home Living Room Bedroom Office Decoration","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519vLUPzxML._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Warm Tips: 1. The wall clock stickers numbers and hands have a protective film, please tear it off after installation. 2. Please hang the clock on the wall, wait for 10~30 minutes to check the minute hand move well. Specifications : Size: the DIY clock size is adjustable as you like （100cm / 39.37”-120cm / 45.24”） Material: EVA foam stickers,acrylic,alloy clock face Hour hand: 31cm /12\" Minute hand: 39cm / 15.3\" Clock machine: 12cm/ 4.72\" Time accuracy: -0.8~+1.2second/day Power: 1*AA battery (not included) Clock color: Gold, Silver, Black Package Included: 1 x DIY Wall Clock Kit (without Battery). 1x Instruction Instruction: Step1 :Use a hammer to knock the nail into wall,then hang clock tray on the wall Step2 :Hang the paper scale on the clock tray, according to the scale to mark numbers’ position Step3 : Remove the paper from back of acrylic mirrors,then fit with matching EVA Step4 : Remove the back paper of EVA;stick to the wall Step5 :Tear off the protective films from mirrors Step6 :Fix the hour hand and minute hand one by one along the 12 o’clock position Step7 :Tighten the nut Step8 :Install a carbon AA battery for clock,adjust the time with gear button of quartz Step9 :Hanging the clock return to wall.Well done!You can enjoy your art-work now","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519vLUPzxML._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SIEMOO","source_asin":"B07TYV8FS2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-589945","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TYV8FS2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TYV8FS2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
