window.products.push({"id":589949,"name":"Zulay Kids Knife Set for Cooking and Cutting Fruits, Veggies & Cake - Perfect Starter Knife Set for Little Hands in the Kitchen - 3-Piece Nylon Knife ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hSZW9go6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Great Starter Knife Set for Little Hands! Putting the focus on safety, the Zulay serrated nylon knife set is designed to start off young cooks who have never handled a knife, by mimicking the shape, weight and feel of a chef’s knife without the sharp edge. The serrated edge makes cutting sandwiches, quesadillas, cake, soft fruit and vegetables possible without any nicks or cuts. Safe & Fun Nylon Knives for your Home! Safe kid's cutlery that cuts basic foods but harmless to the skin. The kitchen knife set includes 1 small, 1 medium and 1 large nylon knife. Made from durable nylon 100% BPA Free. Each knife comes with a serrated cutting edge and blunt tip. The rubber handles to ensure a firm grip and prevent slipping. Ergonomic handles are the same size while the blades are progressively larger. The serrated cutting edge is well made and does not wear down with use. The knives are 100% dishwasher friendly. We Focus on Safety! Our main focus is on the safety features so young kids can have fun while learning about cooking in a secure environment. The knives are a perfect size for a child to easily control them. They can cut through basic foods and will not cut through skin. Fun kid's cooking knife, nylon cooking set, premium plastic knives. Lifetime Money Back Guarantee We believe in our product so much that if for any reason you are not fully satisfied, just return your Knife Set and we will give you a full refund, no questions asked.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hSZW9go6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zulay Kitchen","source_asin":"B0829F52QJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-589949","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0829F52QJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0829F52QJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":589950,"name":"Glow in The Dark Blanket 50\" x 60\" Throw Blanket Unicorn Gifts for Kids Boys Soft Plush Microfiber Flannel Blanket for Kids and Adults","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81STnEc607L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Glow in The Dark Design: The super cool design of the throw blanket for kids is that it can glow in the dark, creating a mysterious and exciting atmosphere in your bedroom. Simply expose the soft blanket to sunlight or a bright light source for 10 to 20 minutes, and it will glow for at least 6 hours. The brighter the light, the stronger the blanket will glow in the dark. Soft and Comfortable Throw Blanket: The glow in the dark blanket is made of premium polyester, which is very soft, warm, and of amazing quality. This super-soft, comfortable, durable baby blanket is skin-friendly, no shedding, and fade resistant. It is also antistatic, protecting your kids from static worry. Magical Glow in The Dark Gift for Kids: Glow in the dark blanket can surprise children on birthdays, Christmas, Halloween, Thanksgiving Day, Children's Day, and other occasions. If you are struggling with a holiday or birthday gift, this throw blanket is a perfect choice. The glow in the dark blankets can inspire fun ideas for children to enjoy magical blankets at night. Blankets for Many Occasions: This ultra-soft throw blanket is ideal for lying on the sofa, bed, couch, or on car journeys. It's also a perfect lap blanket for both young and elders. It will keep you warm during the fall-winter time and cool for spring-summer nights or air-conditioned rooms. Lightweight yet warm. The size of 50\" x 60\" is suitable for people of all ages. Easy to Wash and Care: This durable, hypoallergenic fabric actually becomes softer and stronger with every wash and never pills, frays, or fades. Just toss the throw blanket in your washing machine on the gentle/cold wash cycle and then air/tumble dry on low for the best long-term care.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81STnEc607L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MJRASG","source_asin":"B0B4595MBL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-589950","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4595MBL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4595MBL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
