window.products.push({"id":589956,"name":"Focily 3D Crystal Ball Music Box with Projection LED Light and 360 ° Rotating Wooden Base, Best Gift for Mom Girlfriend Women Kids on Mothers Day Chil","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-Me-x9JwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[HIGH QUALITY & DURABLE MUSIC BOX] - The Crystal ball is made of K9 Crystal Glass, which has excellent transmittance, refraction effect, hardness and texture. Interior image is carved by advanced 3D laser engraving technology, several beautiful patterns for you to choose, The bottom of the musical box, a high-quality rotating movement to make you enjoy the most beautiful melody [NATURAL WOODEN BASE] - The base of the 3D crystal ball music box is made of high quality European natural beech wood with beautiful and elegant texture. The surface is sanded very smooth and free of paint, it reflects the design concept of health, nature and environmental protection fully [ROMANTIC MUSIC BOX] - Twist the clockwork, the classic music of \"Castle in the Sky\" will play slowly, with a clear and melodious sound. Turn on the power switch, the 12 LED light in the base cast a beautiful lotus circle on the ceiling. The snow globe and lotus pattern rotate 360° with the melody playing, very romantic and dreamy. Battery capacity: 1200mAh, Charging time: 2-3H, Lighting time: 8-12H. [MULTIPLE OCCASIONS] - You can give a music box to your family and friends, mom dad children as a great gift on any occasion, such as Mother's Day, Valentine's Day, Thanksgiving, Christmas, birthday, wedding and anniversary. Crystal night light creates a warm light, great decoration for bedroom, living room, nightstand, dinner table and party [MEET YOUR NEED] - Our music boxes are beautifully packed in gift exquisite box, so you don't need to spend extra time and money on gift wrapping. ★ If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us, we are committed to providing the high quality products and efficient customer service","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-Me-x9JwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Focily","source_asin":"B09TKNCDL9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-589956","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TKNCDL9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TKNCDL9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":589957,"name":"Humidifiers for Bedroom Portable Cool Mist Humidifiers 2L Top Fill Air Humidifier Dual Nozzle Spray Quiet Smart Ultrasonic Humidifiers for Baby, Home,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.29,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51LzTsh-REL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Intelligent Constant Temperature Humidification - This bedroom humidifier has a built-in sensitive sensing device that can sensitively and quickly determine the humidity of the air environment, adjust the humidity in real time and humidify intelligently. Perfect for pregnant women, babies, the elderly, sensitive people, etc., so you will feel fresh air and no worries in any season. Dual Nozzle Design Humidifier - This cool mist humidifier has three humidification modes: continuous humidification, indirect humidification and automatic humidification. Dual nozzle design, large mist volume, microporous nano spray, no condensation of water beads, no wet desk, no wet environment, you can choose the right spray mode according to your environment and space. Silver Ionized Water Tank - The small humidifier is equipped with a large 2L water tank with 80ml/h spray volume, which can keep working for up to 24 hours when filled with water. Water is filled from the top without opening the lid, and the water level can be seen by the front transparent water level meter. The water tank contains silver ions, which can keep the water clean, and more importantly, the silver ions have no side effects, safe and healthy. Portable Humidifiers for Desk - The small humidifiers for bedroom with built-in 4000mAh high-capacity battery, 5 hours long battery life, with a leather carry strap, compact size, suitable for a variety of scenarios, such as home, office, car, hotel, long-distance travel, etc. Cool Mist Humidifiers for Bedroom Quiet - Safe low voltage 5V/2A, operates at 10dB, barely audible, providing maximum relaxation while sleeping or working. RGB soft night light can create a sweet and romantic sleeping atmosphere and improve your sleep quality. If there is any dissatisfaction, please contact us promptly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51LzTsh-REL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HUIQIMEI","source_asin":"B0C65WF8WP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-589957","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C65WF8WP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C65WF8WP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":589958,"name":"24 Inch Solid Metallic Copper Barn Star Made with Galvanized Metal to Prevent Rusting. Amish Hand Made Your Source for Heavy Duty Metal Tin Barn Stars","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":54.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21tPkSELJGL._AC_.jpg","description":"24 Inch Solid Metallic Copper Barn Star Made with Galvanized Metal to Prevent Rusting. Amish Hand Made Your Source for Heavy Duty Metal Tin Barn Stars and Primitive Style Stars for Your Country Crafts and Home and Garden Decor. American Handcrafted - Made in the Usa! Heavy duty 22 gauge handcrafted galvanized metal tin barn star, painted barn red in solid paint coverage. Our barn stars are made for outdoor use (no rust will run down the side of your building!) but are perfect for indoor use as well. Painted stars begin with an industrial coat of primer and are topped with a couple coats of severe weather exterior paint. All barn stars in 10 inch, 16 inch and 24 inch are spot welded together. Sizes 32 inch, 40 inch, 53 inch, 72 inch, 96 inch and 120 inch require quick and easy assembly; they arrive in 5 separate wings - simply lay the wings on top of each other and insert the provided screws into the holes and attach the nuts on the back. Hanging brackets are spot welded on the back of the top tip of the 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 10, 16, 24, 32, 40, 53 and 72 inch stars for easy hanging. We highly recommend drilling holes in the tips of the 72, 96, and 120 inch stars for attachment onto a surface. Please note that the 3, 4, 5, 6, and 7 inch stars are 22 gauge steel and are not galvanized metal at this time but will soon be offered in galvanized. The back of those sized stars will arrive as bare steel and are susceptible to rusting. We recommend spraying a clear coat (readily available in a Wal-Mart store for about $1) on the back to keep them from rusting and running down the side of your building. Shipping time is about 5 or 6 days because each star is painted at the time of order. It needs a few days to cure so you will get a quality star. Colors viewed on different computer moniters may distort exact shade of color.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21tPkSELJGL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AMISH WARES","source_asin":"B00AXJFDUK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-589958","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00AXJFDUK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00AXJFDUK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
